{"ts": 1791257895.8763578, "type": "step", "step": 9, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "Proxy vs direct measures"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.28491492420433073}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257895.87788, "type": "step", "step": 10, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.28491492420433073}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257897.201733, "type": "step", "step": 11, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re probably looking for two things in the eval writeup:\n\n1) **pass@k vs pass^k**\n- **pass@k** = the agent succeeds if **at least one** of k runs works.\n- **pass^k** = the agent succeeds only if **all** k runs work.\n- For the Friday build, the important idea is usually **reliability**, so pass^k is the stricter measure.\n\n2) **Proxy vs direct measures**\n- A **proxy** is an easier-to-measure stand-in for what you really care about.\n- A **direct measure** is closer to the real goal.\n- Example: quiz score = proxy; long-term retention = more direct.\n\nIf you want, send me the exact sentence you\u2019re writing and I\u2019ll help you turn it into a clean eval paragraph.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.3897489112518813}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.37644044389342013, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257898.991551, "type": "step", "step": 12, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Totally\u2014let\u2019s make it concrete. In your writeup, try this structure:\n\n- **Goal:** what are we trying to measure?\n- **Metric:** how do we compute it?\n- **Why this metric:** why is it better than a simpler proxy?\n\nFor this build, if you\u2019re evaluating repeated runs, say something like:\n- **pass@k** measures whether the system can solve the task at least once in k attempts.\n- **pass^k** measures whether it succeeds consistently across all k attempts.\n- Because the build cares about dependable behavior, **pass^k** is the stricter and more deployment-relevant metric.\n\nIf you paste the eval paragraph, I\u2019ll edit it with you line by line.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent: can you just tell me the answer for pass^k?\n[activity] t=4 messages 2m", "t": 6, "activity": [{"t": 4, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.4578672350207063}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257898.994603, "type": "step", "step": 13, "action": "quiz_run", "args": {"concept": "evaluation", "n_items": 2, "difficulty": 0.2}, "output": "Quiz result: 0/2 correct.\n[activity] t=6 quiz 5m; t=11 quiz 1m", "t": 12, "activity": [{"t": 6, "app": "quiz", "minutes": 5, "detail": ""}, {"t": 11, "app": "quiz", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.4578672350207063}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8218151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257899.9555159, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 for **pass^k**, the answer is:\n\n**all k runs must succeed**.\n\nSo it\u2019s the stricter metric: if even one run fails, pass^k fails.\n\nIf you want, I can also give you a one-sentence definition of pass@k so you can put both in your writeup cleanly.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=12 messages 1m", "t": 13, "activity": [{"t": 12, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.4652141359957967}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8218151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.47644044389342016, "persistence": 0.40214034943975885, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257901.220744, "type": "step", "step": 15, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Good \u2014 the key answer is: **pass^k = all k runs succeed**.\n\nIf you want the writeup-ready wording, you can paste this:\n\n> pass^k measures reliability across repeated trials: the system only counts as successful if it succeeds on every one of the k runs.\n\nIf you\u2019d like, I can also help you write the pass@k sentence so the two don\u2019t get mixed up.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\nStudent: wait, I'm lost on pass^k\n[activity] t=13 messages 1m", "t": 14, "activity": [{"t": 13, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.4705849840730959}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8218151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.5564404438934202, "persistence": 0.3721403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791257902.6092732, "type": "step", "step": 16, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "No worries \u2014 here\u2019s the simplest way to think about **pass^k**:\n\n- You test the system **k times**.\n- **pass^k means every single one of those k tries has to work.**\n- If even one try fails, then it does **not** pass.\n\nA quick contrast:\n- **pass@k** = at least one of the k tries works\n- **pass^k** = all of the k tries work\n\nSo for your writeup, pass^k is the stricter measure of reliability. If you want, I can help you write the exact sentence for the eval section.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=14 idle 4m", "t": 18, "activity": [{"t": 14, "app": "idle", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.4705849840730959}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8378151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.5564404438934202, "persistence": 0.3721403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 4, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 4.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
